  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="06047159-57e8-5fb0-beaa-ff2dc4e99825" activityNameId="2b37771f-5592-5b6e-9e36-494fd6f529ce" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Hay intensive organic, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Hay intensive organic, at farm
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of barn-dried hay from intensive organic production. The net dry matter yield is 2702 kg/ha.;
UUID: 01ffbdcb-29a2-3370-a000-d903fa6215cf
The inventories include the cultivation of hay on a permanent meadow. Included steps are fertilisation (cattle slurry and manure), harvest, transport to the farm, drying with cold air in the barn and the storage in the barn during 12 months.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Intensive organic production with cold-air drying in the barn.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 538352ha intensive permanent meadows (Switzerland 2004)
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_01ffbdcb-29a2-3370-a000-d903fa6215cf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
